7,AIATSIS AustLang Online,https://aiatsis.gov.au/austlang/language/G8,"On Wills Creek from south of Duchess to Fort William; on Burke River and Mort River to north of Chatsworth; at Noranside and Buckingham Downs (Tindale 1974). Tindale's location leaves a sustantial gap between Yalarnnga and its western neighbour Warluwarra and it seems likely that Yalarnnga country extended further west, perhaps to Ardmore and certainly including Dajarra. Warluwarra speakers ...",Yalarnnga,Australian
